title Vinyl: Playback with the Transition row (owner, 2026-11-20: one setting in place of Gapless and the 0.7.0 draft's Crossfade), its pick list Normal, Gapless, Crossfade 5 sec, Crossfade 10 sec, Crossfade 20 sec with its line of help; a choice closes the list and Playback shows it; Enter and the keys as on the other pick lists
sizes 800x480 480x480 720x720 480x800 480x640 1280x720
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE playback

wait 900
shot 01-playback
expect text "Transition"
expect text "Gapless"
expect notext "Crossfade"
expect text "ReplayGain"
tap "Transition"
wait 400
shot 02-transition-list
expect text "TRANSITION"
expect text "Normal"
expect text "Crossfade 5 sec"
expect text "Crossfade 20 sec"
expect text "Normal leaves a short pause between tracks; Gapless none. Crossfade overlaps the end of a track and the start of the next."
tap "Crossfade 10 sec"
wait 400
shot 03-playback-10s
expect text "Crossfade 10 sec"
expect notext "TRANSITION"
# the keys: Transition is the first row, Enter opens the list on the chosen value, Up and Enter choose Crossfade 5 sec
key enter
wait 400
expect text "TRANSITION"
key up
key enter
wait 400
shot 04-playback-5s
expect text "Crossfade 5 sec"
expect noquit
